@title PLC panel lesson: each step with the lesson card open, done with the keys the card names
@area Cabinet
# The lesson card at each step: open the cabinet, Place all (preview), accept (15 placed), heat with its legend, 3D.
# Heat is Shift+H; at 1366 its button sits under More. In 3D the F key fits the view.
click_text "Learn…"
wait 15
text PLC panel
wait 8
shot learn-search
check_layout
click_text Start #1
wait 40
shot step1-open
check_layout
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 40
shot step2-place-all-card
check_blank step2-place-all-card
check_layout
click_text "Ctrl+Shift+P" #1
wait 40
shot step2-preview
check_layout
key Enter
wait 40
shot step3-15-placed
expect "15 placed"
check_layout
key shift+h
wait 60
shot step4-heat-map
check_blank step4-heat-map
check_layout
click_text 3D
wait 60
key f
wait 40
shot step5-3d
check_blank step5-3d
check_layout
